  "question": {
    "text": "Total number of covalent bonds in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is x and y is the number of sp-hybridised atom. Find the sum of x + y?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "11",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></munder><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></munder><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></munder><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br />There are eight covalent bonds in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2,</mn></mrow></msub></math> so x = 8 and y = 3 as 3 C-atoms are sp-hybridised.<br />So x + y = 8 + 3 = 11.",
